<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30727" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nĕo</span></b> , ēvi,
			ētum, 2, v. a.
		root ne-; Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέω, νήθω</span>; cf.
			Sanscr. nah = nectere, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>to spin.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subtemen tenue nere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Merc. 3, 1, 20</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov.
				Med. Fac. 14</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sic stamina nevit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. F.
					2, 771</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nerunt fatales fortia fila deae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					P. 1, 8, 64</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Parcae fatalia nentes Stamina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					1, 7, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to weave; to
				interlace, entwine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tunicam mater quam neverat auro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 818</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hoc neverat unum mater opus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 9, 691</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter se radices mutuo discursu nentur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 20, 33, § 144</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
